<subexercises xml:id="pr-TorF2">
<title>Part D</title>
<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Determine whether each sentence is true or false in the model given.</p>
<tabular><col halign="right"/><col halign="center"/><col halign="left"/>
<row><cell>UD</cell><cell>=</cell><cell>{Waylan, Willy, Johnny}</cell></row>
<row><cell><m>\extension{H}</m></cell><cell>=</cell><cell>{Waylan, Willy, Johnny}</cell></row>
<row><cell><m>\extension{W}</m></cell><cell>=</cell><cell>{Waylan, Willy}</cell></row>
<row><cell><m>\extension{R}</m></cell><cell>=</cell><cell>{<m>\ntuple{Waylan, Willy}</m>,<m>\ntuple{Willy, Johnny}</m>,<m>\ntuple{Johnny, Waylan}</m>}</cell></row>
<row><cell><m>\referent{m}</m></cell><cell>=</cell><cell>Johnny</cell></row></tabular>
<p>
<ol>
<li><m>\exists x(Rxm \eand Rmx)</m></li>
<li><m>\forall x(Rxm \eor Rmx)</m></li>
<li><m>\forall x(Hx \eiff Wx)</m></li>
<li><m>\forall x(Rxm \eif Wx)</m></li>
<li><m>\forall x\bigl[Wx \eif(Hx \eand Wx)\bigr]</m></li>
<li><m>\exists x Rxx</m></li>
<li><m>\exists x\exists y Rxy</m></li>
<li><m>\forall x \forall y Rxy</m></li>
<li><m>\forall x \forall y (Rxy \eor Ryx)</m></li>
<li><m>\forall x \forall y \forall z\bigl[(Rxy \eand Ryz) \eif Rxz\bigr]</m></li></ol></p></statement>
<solution>
<p>4, 
5, 
and 7 
are true in the model.</p></solution></exercise>
</subexercises>
